@gateway = http://localhost:5070
@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Gateway health
GET {{gateway}}/gateway/health

### Downstream API health
GET {{gateway}}/health

### System API
GET {{gateway}}/api/system/info

### Public login route (use valid request body)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Protected API with query string and JWT
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/vehicles?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Parking API route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/parking-lots
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Booking API route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Image metadata route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/images/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Multipart image upload (replace the file path)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ImageBoundary

--ImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="parking.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\path\to\parking.png
--ImageBoundary--
